// IntroString :
"P692012120" "I bet you feel like you are on top of the world right now. Destined One for real and all that. One thing that has always bugged me was what exactly the Destined Ones are destined to do. I think we should leave that until you are a little more experienced however. Right now, I gather you probably just want to get out into the world and make a name for yourself. That's easy enough. There is a Hero in Paragon that could use a beating. Her name is Overdrive. I have a ship waiting to take you to Paragon to teach this whelp a lesson."
// AcceptString :
"P429931305" "Beat the tar out of Overdrive"
// SendOffString :
"P613923248" "That ship has orders to wait for your arrival before departing."
